# Optional: public API origin for `vite build` / `vite preview` (production mode).
# When set, the UI requests `${VITE_API_URL}/api/...`. Leave unset for relative `/api` (same host as the UI).
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-api.onrender.com
#
# `vite dev` ignores this — requests stay same-origin `/api/...` (Vite proxy).
